# Generated at deploy time by site_data.py (see update-dashboard.yml) -
# never committed. The workflow uploads site/ (including this run's
# freshly-generated data/) straight to a GitHub Pages artifact, so
# there's nothing here to commit in the first place - keeping these
# files out of git is what stops the deploy from ever triggering itself.
# A local preview needs to generate its own copy first - see README.md.
site/data/*.json
site/data/*.csv
